        ],
        "suggestion": "Replace bag-level dependencies with scalar dependencies in `useSegmentSlotModeData`, memoize stable slices in `useInlineEditState` (`useMemo`/`useCallback` per concern), and pass narrowed props to `InlineEditCanvas`/`InlineEditSidebar` so unchanged branches can stay referentially stable.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
