          "`useGetTask(taskId)` queries `.from('tasks').select('*').eq('id', taskId).single()` with no `project_id` constraint and no preflight scope verifier.",
          "In the same subsystem, mutation paths (`updateGenerationLocation`, `toggleGenerationStar`, delete helpers) require `projectId` and call `ensureProjectScope` plus `verifyGenerationScope`/`verifyVariantScope` before write operations."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Make task reads follow the same scope contract: require `projectId` in `useGetTask`, filter by both `id` and `project_id`, and/or introduce a shared `verifyTaskScope` helper used by all task read/write hooks.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
