        "related_files": [
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/ImageLightbox.tsx",
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/hooks/useSharedLightboxState.ts"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`ImageLightbox` imports many hooks and constructs multiple environment/shared/edit layers before render, indicating orchestration and view concerns remain intertwined.",
          "`useSharedLightboxState` defines many grouped prop sub-interfaces and a large nested return contract, effectively functioning as a broad parameter bag API.",
          "The breadth of inputs/outputs increases coupling cost for each feature addition because many call sites and type groupings must be updated together."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Split shared lightbox state into narrower domain slices (variants, shot-actions, references/join, navigation) behind composable hooks with minimal contracts, and have `ImageLightbox` assemble only the slices required for active feature flags.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
