          "This creates two structural ways to assemble the same behavior, increasing drift risk when submission flow changes."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Choose a single composition entrypoint (prefer `useSubmissionHandlers` + `usePromptQueueHandlers`) and refactor `useFormSubmission` into a thin delegator or remove one path entirely. Add focused tests for the chosen composition seam so future changes don\u2019t fork behavior.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
      "status": "auto_resolved",
      "note": "Disappeared from scan \u2014 likely fixed",
