        ],
        "evidence": [
          "useAdjacentPagePreloader.ts sets `totalPages` to `Infinity` when `totalItems` is absent.",
          "adjacentPagePreloadCoordinator.ts checks `currentPage < totalPages`; with Infinity this is always true, so every page keeps scheduling a next-page prefetch regardless of known terminal bounds."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Represent unknown totals as `null` instead of Infinity and gate next-page prefetch on explicit `hasMore`/cursor metadata from the query response.",
