        "evidence": [
          "`src/shared/hooks/useGenerationMutations.ts` throws `normalizeAndPresentError(variantError, ...)` (line ~250), but mutation-level `onError` handlers also call `normalizeAndPresentError(...)`, so one failure can be normalized multiple times.",
