        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`ProductTour` uses `pauseThenAdvance` and additional nested timers in joyride callback (including recursive `waitForTarget`) but does not track/cancel all outstanding timers during unmount or run-state changes.",
          "`useSegmentSlotMode` sets `frameCountDebounceRef.current = setTimeout(...)` for frame updates, but there is no cleanup effect to clear the pending timeout when the hook unmounts."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Centralize timer management with refs plus a single cleanup effect (`return () => clearTimeout(...)` for every active timer). For recursive polling, store a cancellation flag/ref and stop scheduling once unmounted or when run conditions change.",
