    "review::.::holistic::design_coherence::lightbox_adapter_surface_bloat::e99db40f": {
      "id": "review::.::holistic::design_coherence::lightbox_adapter_surface_bloat::e99db40f",
      "detector": "review",
      "file": ".",
      "tier": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "summary": "Lightbox abstractions rely on oversized adapter contracts that re-centralize many concerns.",
      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "design_coherence",
        "related_files": [
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/ImageLightbox.tsx",
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/hooks/useSharedLightboxState.ts",
          "src/shared/components/MediaGallery/components/MediaGalleryLightbox.tsx",
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/components/EditModePanel.tsx"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`ImageLightbox` constructs a large `SharedLightboxInput` object with core/navigation/shots/layout/actions/media sections in one mapper (`ImageLightbox.tsx` lines 200-260), while the component already owns environment state, edit orchestration, and layout behavior.",
          "`useSharedLightboxState` exposes a very broad return model (variants/navigation/star/references/lineage/shots/source/make-main/effective-media/layout/button props) in a single hook contract (`useSharedLightboxState.ts` lines 137-246).",
          "`MediaGalleryLightbox` repeats the same adapter construction pattern and local data-shaping logic (cache subscription + media enhancement + adapter assembly) before handing off to `MediaLightboxFromAdapter` (`MediaGalleryLightbox.tsx` lines 193-237, 281-357)."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Split the lightbox into explicit capability modules (for example `variants`, `shotActions`, `navigation`, `taskDetails`) with narrow typed ports, then compose these in thin container components. Replace the monolithic adapter object with feature-specific props so each caller wires only the capabilities it uses.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
      "status": "auto_resolved",
      "note": "not reported in latest holistic re-import",
      "first_seen": "2026-02-25T21:28:04+00:00",
      "last_seen": "2026-02-25T21:28:04+00:00",
