          "src/shared/lib/errorHandling/errorNotifier.ts"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`normalizeAndPresentError` always routes through report+presentation path (`notifyError`) based on options/appError state.",
          "Presenter installation happens in app bootstrap (`installErrorNotifier`), creating hidden runtime coupling between core error API behavior and app boot sequence.",
          "With 246 importers from holistic context, this mixed concern becomes a central architectural dependency."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Split the fa\u00e7ade into explicit layers: keep `reportError` for core normalization/logging and add a UI-layer adapter (`presentError`) invoked only by UI/application shells. Replace broad direct `normalizeAndPresentError` imports in lower-level modules with pure reporting API.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
      "status": "fixed",
