          "Large UI surfaces also consume aggregate context (`MediaGalleryItem.tsx:138`), increasing cross-cutting dependency spread."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Deprecate `useProject()` behind a migration plan, convert consumers to narrow hooks (`useProjectSelectionContext`, `useProjectCrudContext`, `useProjectIdentityContext`), and enforce via lint rule to prevent new aggregate-context usage.",
