          "src/tools/travel-between-images/components/Timeline.tsx",
          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/MediaLightboxInputAdapter.tsx"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Feature-layer contract defines `onDelete?: (id) => Promise<void>` and narrows `onCreateShot` to `Promise<void>` (`MediaGalleryLightbox.tsx:33,78`).",
          "Canonical lightbox API defines `onDelete?: (id) => void` and `onCreateShot?: Promise<{shotId?: string; shotName?: string} | void>` (`MediaLightbox.tsx:31,44`).",
          "Timeline\u2019s sibling integration still uses the richer `onCreateShot` payload (`Timeline.tsx:71`), showing divergence between callers to the same adapter target.",
          "Adapter simply spreads partial groups into props (`MediaLightboxInputAdapter.tsx:102-112`), so there is no normalization layer to reconcile these mismatches."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Define a single exported callback contract source for lightbox integrations (e.g., shared adapter contract types), import it from both MediaGallery and Timeline, and eliminate local redefinitions that narrow or alter async/return semantics.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
      "status": "fixed",
      "note": "Unified lightbox delete callback contract to shared MediaLightbox types (void|Promise), removed local contract narrowing in MediaGallery/Timeline adapters, and aligned adapters to pass/consume the shared callback shape.",
