          "src/shared/components/MediaLightbox/components/LightboxShell.tsx"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "`MediaLightboxProps` is a broad mixed interface (navigation, workflow, editing, task details, pane state, external integration), then re-grouped in `useBundledLightboxProps`, showing interface sprawl.",
          "`MediaGalleryLightbox.tsx` defines `LightboxSessionModel` plus multiple sub-contract interfaces and mostly translates/destructures state into lightbox props, a high indirection handoff.",
          "`LightboxShell.tsx` blends modal interaction policy with viewport/pane layout policy, making ownership boundaries between layout system and media workflow less direct."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Split by responsibility: create mode-specific containers (`ImageLightboxContainer`, `VideoLightboxContainer`) with narrow inputs, move shared overlay mechanics into a reusable overlay boundary module, and reduce session model shape to minimal per-mode contracts.",
        "reasoning": ""
      },
      "status": "fixed",
      "note": "Introduced explicit mode-specific containers (ImageLightboxContainer and VideoLightboxContainer) to own mode rendering contracts, moved MediaLightbox to shared+mode container composition instead of repeated pass-through orchestration, and flattened MediaGalleryLightbox session contract to a minimal single session shape.",
