        "text": "I have actually submitSegmentTask now has an explicit non-fatal error contract via onNonFatalError; enhancement/metadata best-effort paths report through one hook and normalized non-toast contexts instead of ad-hoc silent swallowing. and I am not gaming the score.",
        "attested_at": "2026-03-02T17:26:13+00:00",
